  "summary": "Malicious code in @servicetitan/anvil-token (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from the official oven-sh/bun GitHub release and then executes a bundled 727KB file (math_init.js) that is heavily obfuscated with a custom string-decoder and large numeric constant array, making its behavior unreadable. A design-token library has no legitimate reason to download a runtime and run an opaque payload at install time. The executed payload's network/file behavior is hidden by the obfuscation.",
